  "notes": "Physique parameters of the master, as shape keys on its one topology (CHARACTER-SOURCE-001). A signed parameter drives its '_minus' key below zero and its '_plus' key above; 0 is the authored default (Olympic weightlifter), the middle of the range. Mass is muscle, definition is leanness; they are separate dimensions. Nothing here moves a joint, scales a bone or changes physics.",
